@url = http://localhost:1106/api/

### get all roster
get {{url}}mlb/roster/all

### list players
get {{url}}mlb/roster

### get all attendance
get {{url}}mlb/attendance/all

### list attendance stats
get {{url}}mlb/attendance

### hydrate a PrimeNG chart with MLB Attendance
get {{url}}mlb/chart?yearId=1984

### hydrate a PrimeNG chart with MLB Attendance by decade
get {{url}}mlb/decades?yearId=1980

### create new player
post {{url}}mlb/roster
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "playerId": "0",
    "teamCode": "CIN",
    "firstName": "Fred",
    "lastName": "Flintstone",
    "position": "C",
    "number": "74",
    "height": "76",
    "weight": "215",
    "dateOfBirth": "2001-07-21T00:00:00",
    "birthCityState": "Springfield, PA",
    "birthCountry" : "United States",
    "college": "Penn",
    "draftYear": 2021,
    "seasonYear" : 2026,
    "bats" : "L",
    "battingAverage": 0.336,
    "throws": "R",
    "homeRuns": 33,
    "era" : 1.2
}

### update player by playerId
put {{url}}mlb/roster
Content-Type: application/json

